Subject: [PATCH] ip: declare zynq support for signal_gen_v6 and readout_v2

axis_signal_gen_v6 and axis_readout_v2 declare only <spirit:family>zynquplus
in their IP-XACT supportedFamilies block, so create_bd_cell refuses them on a
Zynq-7000 part:

    ERROR: [BD 5-683] VLNV <QICK:QICK:axis_signal_gen_v6:1.0> is not supported
    for the current part.

This is purely a declaration: qick_processor and axis_avg_buffer ship no
supportedFamilies block at all and instantiate on xc7z020clg400-2 unmodified.
Adding zynq alongside zynquplus is enough for both IP to instantiate AND to
generate -- Vivado retargets the DDS/FIR subcores to the 7-series part itself,
preserving the parameters the RTL depends on (Phase_Width 32, Latency 10,
Phase_Increment Streaming, Resync, SFDR 96) and the 121-tap fir.coe.

diff --git a/firmware/ip/axis_readout_v2/component.xml b/firmware/ip/axis_readout_v2/component.xml
index 438b36e..9307766 100644
--- a/firmware/ip/axis_readout_v2/component.xml
+++ b/firmware/ip/axis_readout_v2/component.xml
@@ -1151,7 +1151,7 @@
   <spirit:vendorExtensions>
     <xilinx:coreExtensions>
       <xilinx:supportedFamilies>
-        <xilinx:family xilinx:lifeCycle="Production">zynquplus</xilinx:family>
+        <xilinx:family xilinx:lifeCycle="Production">zynquplus</xilinx:family><xilinx:family xilinx:lifeCycle="Production">zynq</xilinx:family>
       </xilinx:supportedFamilies>
       <xilinx:taxonomies>
         <xilinx:taxonomy>/QICK/Readout</xilinx:taxonomy>
diff --git a/firmware/ip/axis_signal_gen_v6/component.xml b/firmware/ip/axis_signal_gen_v6/component.xml
index 0e8052c..c515f2c 100644
--- a/firmware/ip/axis_signal_gen_v6/component.xml
+++ b/firmware/ip/axis_signal_gen_v6/component.xml
@@ -1282,7 +1282,7 @@
   <spirit:vendorExtensions>
     <xilinx:coreExtensions>
       <xilinx:supportedFamilies>
-        <xilinx:family xilinx:lifeCycle="Production">zynquplus</xilinx:family>
+        <xilinx:family xilinx:lifeCycle="Production">zynquplus</xilinx:family><xilinx:family xilinx:lifeCycle="Production">zynq</xilinx:family>
       </xilinx:supportedFamilies>
       <xilinx:taxonomies>
         <xilinx:taxonomy>/QICK/Signal_Generator</xilinx:taxonomy>
